WEBVTT

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.240
So you are the eccentric
high-ranking Imperial official

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.740
who amuses himself with map-making.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.490
Virgilio Louis, was it?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.040
By the time the wheat grows rampant in Tharros,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.710
I will be appointed Head Minister
of the Balt-Rhein Empire.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.920
I will no longer be able
to have meetings like this so readily.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.630
And so I've come to share
my feelings before that time comes.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.930
I see.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.890
The Empire killed your father,
Usman, the previous sultan,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.350
during the course of our recent war.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.640
I wanted to offer you my condolences.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:50.650
You think I would forgive you
because you've come to bow your head?

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:57.030
But this was all unnecessary.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:00.870
It was Torqye who dragged my father
into a war he did not wish for.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.660
What killed my father was Muzrak's weakness.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.330
That is all.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.880
I am relieved to hear that.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:12.840
In that case, perhaps I can explain to you
the meaning of my gift.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.380
You are being impudent.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.230
I don't recognize this map.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.810
The world will become as I've drawn it.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:35.400
It is the future of Rumeriana.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.660
Brother, where are the Imperials?

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.160
I've sent them back.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.660
What did they want?

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.170
I will not lend my ears
to the deranged claims of such a man.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.750
But look.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.760
Muzrak...

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.180
independent from Birlik Torqye?

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:09.060
This map is beautiful.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.360
Are you telling me the brother of a sultan
wishes to become a kulak?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.530
Yes.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.200
I believe that the spy network you've established

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.490
is necessary in order to bring peace

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:28.750
to Muzrak and Birlik Torqye.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.040
And should a time come

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:34.250
when Muzrak draws its bow against Birlik Torqye,

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.760
a kulak's position becomes exceedingly dangerous.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.340
I want to stop it from ever coming to that.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.550
I must.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.100
That is the justice I believe in.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.980
Are you saying there is already unrest in Muzrak?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.520
No, I am simply saying

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.110
that I do not wish to see

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.610
what I love go down the wrong path,

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.910
not now or in the future.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:06.450
You've helped me understand
the concerns you have for Muzrak.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.290
I shall grant you your wish.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.170
The kulak position is yours.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:56.060
August 31st, Torqyean Year 75.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.690
On this day, the three armies of
the sultanlus surrounding Acayip's walls

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.400
totaled 23,000 strong.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.820
In comparison, the Kuluch Sultanlu's side

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.950
numbered 5,600 men,

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.870
including the allied Torqye forces.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.040
Sultan Orhan,

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:21.300
please, give us the order to prepare for a siege.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.220
Mahmut Bey, please, lend us your help.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.970
Of course, Sultan Orhan.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.470
However, holding the castle
is not in our best interest.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.220
What did you say?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.600
The defenders have an incredible
advantage in a siege.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.770
If we request reinforcements from Torqye,
we can defeat the enemy.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.320
This is a message from the Divan.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.990
The forces of Torqye are currently marching

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.990
to take the major cities of Muzrak, Balta, and Buchak.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.200
We're to occupy the sultans' forces here

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.120
until Torqye can take control of their cities.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.000
Those are my instructions.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.210
Then all the more reason for us to hold out here

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.510
and wait for Torqye's forces.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.890
There is no guarantee they will.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:13.760
And also, the Balt-Rhein Empire is
lying in wait behind the three sultanlus.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.810
Knowing that the Empire
could use this opportunity to strike,

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.270
the Divan gave you these orders.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:22.900
Exactly.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.990
They're saying as long as we serve
our purpose as their decoys,

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.530
they don't care what happens to Kuluch.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.070
No...

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.240
Even if we rode out to face them,

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.490
they outnumber us four-to-one.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.040
Those are not odds we can overcome.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.540
Actually, that's not entirely the case.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.540
Mahmut Bey.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.550
I have sent Suleyman Bey to confirm the situation.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.550
What do you mean?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:05.270
Just like I said, you're not the only one
with tricks up his sleeve.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.980
Yes.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.990
But I had hoped we wouldn't have to resort to this.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.780
It is okay.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.160
As I've told you before,

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.750
my brother Balaban will never abandon
his ambition on his own.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.040
Not as long as he's alive.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.540
I understand.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.300
Then with that in mind,

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.760
I have a favor to ask.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.260
Anything.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.930
Zaganos Pasha,

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.470
I willingly took this role.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.350
That is why I am not afraid to die here.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.610
But that is not the case for them.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.320
If your orders are to do whatever necessary,

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.240
then I will do things my way.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.700
I will not let Acayip share
the same fate as Tughril Village.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.290
Your plan is promising.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.580
Uncle Balaban has the habit of torturing his prey

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.790
instead of killing them immediately.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.550
If my uncle has any weaknesses at all,

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.590
it is his intense, self-righteous pride.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.140
What are you doing? Are you insane?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.140
Sultan Balaban.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.730
Saluja Pasha.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.440
I am very grateful to you.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.690
I owe you my life, so to speak.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:31.030
Thanks to you babbling about your ludicrous notion

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.280
of restoring Birlik Torqye,

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.610
my life was saved.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.410
Then that means...

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.000
When you said you wanted
to rebuild Birlik Torqye...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.620
That was a lie?

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.290
You poor thing.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.000
The four sultanlus and the Torqye Pashalu.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.590
You loved both,

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.180
but you could not choose a side?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.680
As my final gift to you,

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.180
I shall bury the right half of your body in Torqye,

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.600
and the left half in the land of the sultans.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.950
To challenge us outside the castle
being this outnumbered?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.790
It's as if they've come to be slaughtered.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:25.120
Or is this a desperate act,
sensing they have no chance of victory?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.000
Beyazit.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.170
You would defy me to the end?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.920
Very well.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:40.140
There is no honor in crushing you with 20,000 men.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:47.230
Even rabbit hunts must be entertaining.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.730
What did you say?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:54.150
Sultan Balaban sends word that
his yenicheris are enough for this battle,

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.690
and does not need assistance.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.040
Five thousand exactly.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.210
He's adjusted his numbers to ours.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.960
I'll never understand his way of thinking.

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:13.210
But now he has stepped up
to play the same game as us.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.760
Beyolu Beyazit,

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.800
thank you for your assistance.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.090
Beyolu Ismail,

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.010
please, rendezvous with Suleyman Bey.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.810
Leave the rest to us.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.640
Yes, but when the time comes,

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.270
there is no need to hold back.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.900
May fortune be with you.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.150
-Bey, we should go too.
-Yes.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.360
Get into formation!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.830
Balta - Buchak
Kuluch - Muzrak

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.490
Five thousand vs. five thousand.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:50.790
Both Sultan Fatma and Sultan Uzun
are cooperating with this irrational plan.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:56.380
So just as I thought, Sultan Balaban
is commanding the three armies.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.470
If we're able to defeat him,

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.890
the remaining armies will collapse.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.720
As I'd expect from Torqye's star pupil.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.640
It's the very first formation
you'd learn in cadet school.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.810
While the infantry buy time,
the flanking cavalries attack from behind,

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.190
collapsing the formation and routing the enemy.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.570
But there is one issue with that plan.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:24.200
It's that the flanking cavalries cannot fail.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.540
Slaughter the enemy!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.160
Let's go!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.750
All forces, charge!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.430
Five hundred of my yenicheris,

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.930
and 800 royal guards.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.430
While your right flank may be able to advance,

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.940
you had to divert men
from the left flank to do so.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.940
How do you expect to fight our cavalry
with only half the numbers?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.190
What is that?

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.740
That ruins the beautiful form of the cavalry.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.450
The horses faltered.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.450
Ak Alay!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:15.920
So the unsightly tree branch was a ploy
to compensate for being outnumbered.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.460
However...

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.670
That will not be enough to break our forces.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:21.920
Fire!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.840
Retreat! Fall back! Fall back!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.220
You wish to reestablish your formations?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.310
We will not give you that chance.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.810
Mavi Alay!

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.490
-We cannot see the enemy.
-Do not panic.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.870
Continue advancing forward.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.120
They will be beyond the cloud of dust.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.040
Charge forward.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.290
We will separate Sultan Balaban from the infantry.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.340
It's begun.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.010
Hold fire.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.300
Full reversal. Fall back.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.680
What is going on?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:09.430
They're planning to flank behind our infantry.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.100
Reestablish formation!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.640
Give chase!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.320
Fall back!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.500
Once you see the cloud of dust,
that will be our signal.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.500
The time has come. I have to move the troops.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.250
Ch--

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.760
Sultan, your orders.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.430
All forces,

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.600
move to reverse bow formation.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.810
-What is happening?
-The enemy is retreating.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.770
It doesn't matter. We'll break through their lines.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.190
Kuluch's tricks will not work on us.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.410
What was our cavalry doing?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.540
Reestablish the rear line.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.000
I cannot see anything from here.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.630
Sultan Fatma.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.630
Let us deploy our troops.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.340
This is our chance to crush the enemy.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.590
We mustn't.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:34.310
My brother is the type of man
who would cut down his own family

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.810
if he believes his honor has been insulted.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.480
You made it in time,

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.820
Mahmut Bey.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.120
Oh, brother.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.830
I believe that settles it.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.630
My yenicheris...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.130
Reduced to such humiliation.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.090
Sultan Balaban.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.260
Your precious yenicheris are in shambles.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.060
Withdraw your troops for your own sake.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.940
Or else we will hunt down
every last one of your soldiers

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.480
and reduce them to dust,

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.940
never to see Muzrak again.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.910
How dare you?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.410
I am Muzrak Sultanlu's Sultan Balaban.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.620
Soldiers.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:43.000
Have you forgotten that you've given
your lives over to me and your homeland?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:47.130
Must I remind you that
it is not death you should fear, but shame?

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:51.840
Show them you are the strongest force
in all of Rumeriana.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.100
Damn, he got them fired up fast.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.520
Mahmut Bey, do we have your permission?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.770
Yes.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.280
You rabbits. We will hunt you down.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.870
Follow me!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.000
Beyolu Beyazit...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.420
They're here.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:39.180
Shark Yay Alay, ready your weapons.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.140
Fire.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.190
Calm down.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.150
What was that?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.660
It's an ambush!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.910
They cut off our escape!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.420
Shark Yay Alay, prepare for the next round of fire.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.420
Yay Alay, ready your weapons.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.630
Fire.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.930
Do not falter.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.510
All forces, dismount and enter turtle formation!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.560
Hold formation and fall back.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:33.070
How could I underestimate my enemy
by calling them rabbits?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:40.080
But failures can be recovered
with a greater success.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.290
That is what I've always done.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.370
Too bad for you.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.080
These are magic weapons Rumeriana

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.090
has never had the pleasure of experiencing before.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.630
I'm surprised they're not more scared.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:58.220
Your brother really is something.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.140
If this was a battle with only bows and swords,

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:04.640
he would have made a great commander.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.390
It really is a shame.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.770
Fire.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.580
It is time to circle around.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.620
Let us hurry.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.850
Shark yay.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.730
Was it you, Beyazit?

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.440
Fall back at full speed.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.440
The new weapon cannot fire rapidly.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.780
We will withdraw before their next attack.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.950
Fire.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.660
Just how many does he have?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.500
This is ridiculous.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:14.960
I will not let such a stupid mistake be my--

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.630
Beyazit.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.890
You are the only one

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.260
I will never forgive.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.970
Why did you betray me?

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.930
Did I drive you to this?

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:14.190
Did you come to loathe me?

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.940
No.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.530
It is because

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.280
you are not fit to be sultan.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.030
What?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:27.410
The Empire...

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.200
They told you exactly what you wanted to hear,

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.540
to break away from the constraints of Birlik Torqye.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:39.880
Even when you knew in your heart
what destruction that would bring.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:44.760
But you were willing to hand Muzrak,
our homeland, over to the Empire

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.140
for a fleeting sense of victory.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:53.440
The man from the Empire gave you
a glimpse of a short-lived future.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.900
Since that day,

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.560
I knew somewhere deep down

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.900
that it would come to this.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.990
That if I did not stop you,

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.410
I would have to atone for it.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.990
That I would have to stop you at all costs,
even if it meant killing you.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.000
You told me

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.220
you would follow me forever.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:27.550
You said

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.600
you loved me.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:37.060
You told me you...

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.570
And I have.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:56.080
There isn't anyone...

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.250
in all of Rumeriana

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.090
who I've loved more than you.

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:52.570
After visiting many nations,
and meeting many people,

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.990
I've returned to this place.

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.040
Next time, "Conclusion of the Civil War."

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.040
The eagle takes flight once again.
